{
  "id": "vehicles_traffic_flow_and_density",
  "title": "Vehicles Traffic Flow and Density",
  "description": "Traffic flow and density as used in highway design. Calculate vehicle traffic flow (vehicles per hour) and vehicle density (vehicles per mile or per km).",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Vehicles Traffic Flow and Density\n\nTraffic flow and density as used in highway design.\n\n## Vehicle Traffic Flow\n\nThe vehicle traffic flow on a road can be expressed as:\n\n**q = n × 3600 / t**\n\nWhere:\n- **q** = vehicle flow (no. vehicles per hour)\n- **n** = no. vehicles passing in t seconds\n- **t** = time for passing vehicles (s)\n\n## Vehicle Density\n\nVehicle density can be expressed as:\n\n**Imperial (vehicles per mile):**\n**k = n × 5280 / l**\n\n**Metric (vehicles per km):**\n**k = n × 1000 / l**\n\nWhere:\n- **k** = vehicle density (vehicles per mile or per km)\n- **n** = no. of vehicles occupying a length l of the road\n- **l** = the length of road occupied by the vehicles (ft for imperial, m for metric)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Vehicle Traffic Flow Calculation",
        "Vehicle Density Calculation (Imperial)",
        "Vehicle Density Calculation (Metric)"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "num_vehicles_flow",
          "label": "Number of Vehicles (flow)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1000,
          "unit": "vehicles"
        },
        {
          "id": "time_seconds",
          "label": "Time Period",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 7200,
          "unit": "s"
        },
        {
          "id": "num_vehicles_density",
          "label": "Number of Vehicles (density)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 50,
          "unit": "vehicles"
        },
        {
          "id": "road_length_ft",
          "label": "Road Length (imperial)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 5280,
          "unit": "ft"
        },
        {
          "id": "road_length_m",
          "label": "Road Length (metric)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1000,
          "unit": "m"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "vehicle_flow",
          "label": "Vehicle Traffic Flow",
          "formula": "inputs.num_vehicles_flow * 3600 / inputs.time_seconds",
          "unit": "vehicles/h",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "vehicle_density_imperial",
          "label": "Vehicle Density (Imperial)",
          "formula": "inputs.num_vehicles_density * 5280 / inputs.road_length_ft",
          "unit": "vehicles/mile",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "vehicle_density_metric",
          "label": "Vehicle Density (Metric)",
          "formula": "inputs.num_vehicles_density * 1000 / inputs.road_length_m",
          "unit": "vehicles/km",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Metric",
        "Value",
        "Unit",
        "Description"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Vehicle Traffic Flow Formula",
          "q = n × 3600 / t",
          "vehicles/h",
          "Flow rate calculation"
        ],
        [
          "Vehicle Density Formula (Imperial)",
          "k = n × 5280 / l",
          "vehicles/mile",
          "Density with imperial units"
        ],
        [
          "Vehicle Density Formula (Metric)",
          "k = n × 1000 / l",
          "vehicles/km",
          "Density with metric units"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}